Template: ab-worm/retain-days
Type: string
Default: 365
Description: Retention period in days for new WORM files:
 Autobricks WORM will mount /worm-storage at /mnt/worm-storage by default.
 New files created through the mount will use this retention period.
 The source and mount paths can be changed later in /etc/default/ab-worm.
